WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.610 --> 00:00:01.590
- Job interviews.

00:00:01.590 --> 00:00:03.230
- [Job Candidate] Right.
- [Mr. Evans] Nervous.

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:04.180
- So nervous.

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:07.343
- Well, hey, we are the final two.

00:00:07.883 --> 00:00:09.973
So,hey, you have fifty, fifty shot,

00:00:09.973 --> 00:00:11.773
that's a pretty good chance, of a job.

00:00:11.773 --> 00:00:12.853
- I didn't know that.

00:00:12.853 --> 00:00:14.723
- [Lady] Mr Evans we'd like to see you.

00:00:14.723 --> 00:00:15.643
- Yeah, that's me.

00:00:16.413 --> 00:00:17.713
- I'm sorry to have to tell you this,

00:00:17.713 --> 00:00:19.893
but we've decided to go
in a different direction.

00:00:20.403 --> 00:00:21.333
- Oh no.

00:00:21.333 --> 00:00:22.883
(somber music)

00:00:22.883 --> 00:00:24.313
- You didn't get the job.

00:00:24.313 --> 00:00:26.185
I can provide you with excellent resource.

00:00:26.185 --> 00:00:27.483
(sobbing)

00:00:30.203 --> 00:00:31.703
- Oh God.

00:00:31.703 --> 00:00:33.833
- This is the worst day of my life.

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:36.113
- Oh, thank you again for--

00:00:36.113 --> 00:00:37.293
Okay.

00:00:40.613 --> 00:00:42.707
- Hey, how did it go?

00:00:42.707 --> 00:00:43.563
- I got the job.

00:00:44.453 --> 00:00:45.013
Yeah

00:00:45.763 --> 00:00:46.423
- What?

00:00:46.423 --> 00:00:49.973
- Yeah, he just decided to
give me the job on the spot.

00:00:49.973 --> 00:00:51.423
So it was really good in there.

00:00:51.423 --> 00:00:53.063
- If I were you, I would just go home,

00:00:53.063 --> 00:00:54.103
don't even worry about it.

00:00:54.103 --> 00:00:56.303
- I think I should still
go inside and talk to him.

00:00:56.303 --> 00:00:57.853
- I wouldn't do that if I were you.

00:00:57.853 --> 00:00:59.353
- I just did drive all the way down, so--

00:00:59.353 --> 00:01:01.295
- You know what, I just
realized that I forgot my phone

00:01:01.295 --> 00:01:03.193
in there, I'm going to go grab that.

00:01:03.193 --> 00:01:04.743
I'll be right back.

00:01:04.743 --> 00:01:05.523
Just stay there.

00:01:06.413 --> 00:01:08.533
Look, I will do whatever
it takes to get this job.

00:01:08.533 --> 00:01:09.243
- Mr Evans.

00:01:09.243 --> 00:01:11.203
- Please, please, I'm begging you.

00:01:11.203 --> 00:01:12.736
I need this job.

00:01:12.736 --> 00:01:13.993
I need it.

00:01:13.993 --> 00:01:15.293
You don't understand.

00:01:15.293 --> 00:01:16.543
I've got some people after me.

00:01:16.543 --> 00:01:17.583
There, I said it.

00:01:17.583 --> 00:01:18.293
- Mr Evans!

00:01:18.293 --> 00:01:19.323
I need a job!

00:01:19.323 --> 00:01:20.603
Can I have it?

00:01:21.293 --> 00:01:22.055
I'm afraid no.

00:01:22.055 --> 00:01:22.953
- Damn it!

00:01:24.893 --> 00:01:25.883
Okay!

00:01:29.413 --> 00:01:30.815
- Hey, what happened in there?

00:01:30.815 --> 00:01:31.885
- Ah the benefits.

00:01:33.005 --> 00:01:34.627
We were just talking about all the great

00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:36.905
healthcare options I have and I can

00:01:36.905 --> 00:01:39.185
finally get that Lasik eye
surgery I've been wanting.

00:01:39.185 --> 00:01:40.435
I was just picking up the vibe from him

00:01:40.435 --> 00:01:41.695
that you should just go home.

00:01:42.595 --> 00:01:44.065
- I think it's worth a
shot, I'm just going to go.

00:01:44.065 --> 00:01:47.275
- I forgot what we were
talking about at tea time.

00:01:47.275 --> 00:01:50.405
Golf, I forget the number,
it was 9:25 or 10:25.

00:01:50.405 --> 00:01:51.705
I'm going to pick it up.

00:01:51.705 --> 00:01:52.925
Be right back, stay there.

00:01:52.925 --> 00:01:53.725
- Oh come on.

00:01:53.725 --> 00:01:54.665
- I'm giving you one more shot.

00:01:54.665 --> 00:01:56.415
I'm giving you one more shot.

00:01:56.415 --> 00:01:58.455
You don't understand how
much I need this job.

00:01:58.455 --> 00:02:00.565
- No, not my, oh God.

00:02:00.565 --> 00:02:01.625
- I need this job.

00:02:01.625 --> 00:02:02.715
- You have to get out.

00:02:02.715 --> 00:02:03.925
- You want to hire him.

00:02:03.925 --> 00:02:05.385
You want to hire him.

00:02:05.385 --> 00:02:06.795
He looks like he does drugs.

00:02:06.795 --> 00:02:08.595
I saw him sniffing before this.

00:02:09.975 --> 00:02:12.945
You want to hire a druggy, over me?

00:02:12.945 --> 00:02:15.497
Are you kidding me, I want to
do something wild right now.

00:02:15.497 --> 00:02:17.185
- Okay, okay, okay.

00:02:17.185 --> 00:02:17.967
- Give me the job.

00:02:17.967 --> 00:02:18.475
- Hi.

00:02:18.475 --> 00:02:19.815
- Hi, I've got a new hiring!

00:02:19.815 --> 00:02:20.525
- No!

00:02:20.525 --> 00:02:20.975
- Give me it.

00:02:20.975 --> 00:02:21.795
- Get me security please.

00:02:21.795 --> 00:02:22.525
- Give it to me.

00:02:22.525 --> 00:02:23.715
They're going to call security.

00:02:23.715 --> 00:02:24.485
- Mr. Evans?

00:02:25.405 --> 00:02:26.925
- Hey, what the hell, man?

00:02:26.925 --> 00:02:28.145
- I just made partner.

00:02:28.145 --> 00:02:30.125
- I heard you slandering me in there.

00:02:30.125 --> 00:02:32.615
- I was trying to get you a job in there.

00:02:32.615 --> 00:02:34.575
- By saying that I do drugs?

00:02:34.575 --> 00:02:36.665
- I did not do that.

00:02:36.665 --> 00:02:38.915
I just think you need to go man.

00:02:38.915 --> 00:02:40.795
- You know what, I think you're trying

00:02:40.795 --> 00:02:43.155
to get me to leave so that
you get the job by default.

00:02:43.155 --> 00:02:44.715
- That is not, oh security is here.

00:02:44.715 --> 00:02:46.465
That's not what's going on.

00:02:46.465 --> 00:02:48.885
I, oh, look at this, this is so funny.

00:02:48.885 --> 00:02:51.455
This is what they do to the new guys.

00:02:51.455 --> 00:02:52.555
Just hazing the new guy.

00:02:52.555 --> 00:02:53.975
Right, I'll see you guys Monday

00:02:53.975 --> 00:02:55.435
'cause I definitely got the job.

00:02:55.435 --> 00:02:59.115
(electronic music)

00:03:00.942 --> 00:03:02.474
Just one more shot!

